OL,3,AMerz vows to keep coalition together
OL,4,Afor Germany's 'democratic future'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMerz's position has come under mounting
OL,7,Fpressure after Sunday's election
OL,8,Fresults. In the north-eastern
OL,9,FMecklenburg-Vorpommern, the far-right
OL,10,FAlternative for Germany (AfD) party won
OL,11,Fthe most votes, with the CDU failing to
OL,12,Freach the threshold to even enter the
OL,13,Fstate parliament.
OL,15,FMeanwhile in Berlin, the CDU came
OL,16,Fsecond to the hard-left Die Linke
OL,17,Fparty, with the AfD also making
OL,18,Fsignificant gains.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
